Crewhouse runs the official, unmodified agent CLIs you have installed and
signed in yourself (Claude Code, Codex CLI, Pi, ...). It does not bundle,
modify, or redistribute them, and it never reads or copies their credential
files. Those CLIs remain subject to their own licenses and their vendors'
terms.

Crewhouse drives terminal sessions through Herdr (Apache-2.0), which you
install separately.
